  "description": "<p data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"783\">Herbeleef de snelste avonturen uit de geschiedenis van SEGA met <strong data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"374\">Sonic Origins Plus</strong>, een <strong data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"411\">retro-platformgamecollectie</strong> die de legendarische 2D Sonic-games bundelt in één uitgebreide editie.<br data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"485\">Speel door de klassieke titels <em data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"555\">Sonic the Hedgehog 1, 2, 3 & Knuckles</em> en <em data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"569\">Sonic CD</em>, nu met verbeterde graphics, nieuwe speelbare personages (waaronder Amy en Knuckles) en extra content uit de Game Gear-serie.<br data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"698\">De cartridge wordt <strong data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"733\">los geleverd</strong> (zonder hoesje) en verkeert <strong data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"780\">In Nette Staat</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"788\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"808\">🎮 Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<li data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"869\">\r\n<p data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"869\">🌀 <strong data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"841\">Retro-platformcollectie</strong> met klassieke Sonic-games</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"920\">\r\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"920\">⚡ Verbeterde HD-weergave en vloeiende gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"976\">\r\n<p data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"976\">👥 Nieuwe speelbare personages en Game Gear-content</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1026\">\r\n<p data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1026\">🎶 Iconische soundtrack en nostalgische sfeer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1078\">💾 <strong data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1051\">Losse cartridge</strong> – geen hoesje inbegrepen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1083\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1106\">📋 Specificaties</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1412\"><strong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1120\">Platform:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1140\">Nintendo Switch</strong><br data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1143\"><strong data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1153\">Titel:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1176\">Sonic Origins Plus</strong><br data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1179\"><strong data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1189\">Genre:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1218\">Platform / Retro / Actie</strong><br data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1221\"><strong data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1230\">Taal:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1266\">Meertalig (o.a. Engels & Frans)</strong><br data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1269\"><strong data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1281\">Spelers:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1321\" data-is-only-node=\"\">1–2 spelers (afhankelijk van titel)</strong><br data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1324\"><strong data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1337\">Conditie:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1356\">In Nette Staat</strong><br data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1359\"><strong data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1374\">Verpakking:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1410\">Losse cartridge (zonder hoesje)</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1417\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1448\"><strong data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1446\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand</strong></p>",
